#==============================================================================================
#
#   selector_parsing_2 - parsing selectors: attribute selectors and pseudo-classes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/SelectorParsing.cpp (lines 390-870): `[attr op value i]`
#       and `:pseudo-class` / `:pseudo-class(arguments)`, with each kind of argument the
#       pseudo-class metadata names (An+B, An+B of <selector-list>, compound selectors,
#       (forgiving) selector lists, idents, language ranges, levels).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2018-2022, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
